      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be nice to be able to register up to 6 slots for free and up to 6 more slots (12 total) for a fee. (Frankly, I'd like more)\nThere are lots of old worlds that are still in high demand. (e.g. deep blue)\nUnlike in the past, the number of worlds has increased dramatically.\nFavoring only those worlds that continue to be updated properly and decently is not enough at all, and I think it is a waste of time to search for worlds from the list to try to remember them.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
