  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-20T08:00:39.177Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Love the prospect of having more favorite slots for public avatars.\nWould be neat, and totally in line with the increase in favorite avatars, to also be able to have more lists/folders of favorited worlds. This would allow you to be able to better organize them, prepare for world tours with friends etc.",
